ですかね。","ts":"1621827642.065900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PZFsl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17b1a652-076c-459e-aad1-7f86035b5b00","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"実務上は一番知ってる人に引き継ぐのでその誰かがその業務の引き継ぎ対象になっちゃいますね","ts":"1621827603.065400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=z3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"799b2d05-1389-42a2-a2bc-a7d3fde32990","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"それのいきつく先はWindows2000の長老","ts":"1621827592.065300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NZx=q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bedfdfee-c147-4c59-a921-2b4d62fbd32d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"たしかに","ts":"1621827539.064200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wmjV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6783cd40-40a1-43cb-952b-bb993e434b6b","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"誰に聞けばいいっていうのは、本質的には属人化なのであまりよくないんですよね〜","ts":"1621827487.063900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wnn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc6f663e-f761-4788-8042-237d60996ecc","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"就職したことないですが、多分誰に聞けばいいとかあると良さそうかなと思った","ts":"1621827243.062900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nao=J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63fc4c29-7805-407c-bd1d-a83733bde4a8","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"そもそも自分がヒューマンエラーを起こさないようにまとめている資料だったので、その範囲内で書いておけばいいですね。","ts":"1621827162.062000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mTlQ5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0830b6dd-6550-462b-a71b-6fab1a460a44","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"前職最終出社日、ランチでビール飲んだのとみんなでオフィスで集合写真とったぐらいでほとんど仕事してなかったなあとふと思った","ts":"1621826636.061000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LYYst"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cffbc4a3-9091-4d60-af4c-cadeb2ec53ac","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"最終出社日にterraformで自分のアカウント類を消すPR出してPC返してお世話になりました…で終わった","ts":"1621826596.060300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5QLWa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"842a4808-09f6-41f4-aa69-7a27695f51f6","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"yutkat さんも言ってましたけど、その人の職掌で業務時間内にどういうアウトプット（引継ぎ資料を含めて）させるかはマネジメント側の仕事ですね。","ts":"1621826585.060200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9ixmR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58c32ff1-1a03-43b8-bff6-4cb0226b203d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"とりあえず業務時間内にやれる範囲で資料を残す感じにしておきます。~俗に言うブラック企業ならこんな事で悩まないでさっさとトンズラするんですが…。~","ts":"1621826497.059000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OUG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"643e4385-e72e-4dc5-b522-69db08774a0b","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"自分は前職の頃は普段から自分にしかできないことを作らないように心がけていたのでほとんど資料作ったりとかしませんでした。\n引き継ぎは自分が持っていた各種管理者権限を委譲したくらいだったような。","ts":"1621826497.058900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WxyH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aef9620c-8bd7-4d42-9f12-5597fb7f428f","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"個人的にはアメリカスタイルの何も引き継ぎしないが好き（何もしないというわけではない）","ts":"1621826479.058800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p/R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"332c96f3-d36b-4658-afa8-f6e2863c4217","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"いわゆるバス因子ですね","ts":"1621826354.056900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VNOs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c98f1af-a519-44ec-9031-982f8baffaf3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"極端な話、ある日事故で突然人員が抜ける可能性もあるわけで、それで困る体制を作っていた方が悪いとも言える","ts":"1621826092.055800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yr5hq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf07a029-90ad-4dcb-beb2-bf5e9dc72cd8","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"まあ、後任を入れるのは会社の義務でこっちとしては知ったこっちゃねえって話ですしね。","ts":"1621825979.055200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/oqwd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bb53443-55ae-460f-b24a-dd1c1d390158","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"日本は転職２週間前に言えばOKなんで、２週間で残せる範囲の資料（ゼロから書いて）ってのが、普通の引き継ぎ資料だと思いますね。\nそれ以上はその組織の仕事のやり方にも問題がありそうだから１回困ってもらって改善してもらうのでよいと思います。","ts":"1621825788.054200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AF1Xf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d5f46e7-1561-4d70-9146-d157a20fb493","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"なるほど…そこらへんを重点的に書いておいて後はベストエフォートでみたいにしておいても良さそうですね。~あとは残ったオッサン達に丸投げと。~","ts":"1621825541.050700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+2x2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f688625c-797a-4550-aa3f-1a84eccaa53f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"気持ちわかるけどｗ","ts":"1621825533.050600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SAWZe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0031985-a1ee-49c9-a618-c177e5842a12","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"それ、やると永遠に退職でき無さそう","ts":"1621825518.050200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2uQC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fe4253b-b9ac-4970-b808-bbca2082b5e3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"手順を書くより可能な限り自動化していきたいところ","ts":"1621825493.049500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"myM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec257469-e9f4-408c-99c1-4269efc1bb91","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどお","ts":"1621825335.048300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qnUt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"349e6334-a283-4d6b-a0c3-91708e7428d5","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あ〜〜なるほど","ts":"1621825318.048100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xm5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51b17201-dd47-4fc7-b4c4-8c204613122a","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私が退職する人に書いて欲しいって毎回言うのは、よくある作業とその処理フローと、今から私がやるべきはじめの一歩と、あとどういうことをやりたかったかとかそのへんですね。","ts":"1621825310.047800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tZKw2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a46fb5ef-c2af-4bbb-8bfd-0e07344420a6","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あ〜なるほど","ts":"1621825298.047600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gda18"}]},{"client_msg_id":"281e62e6-709d-41af-97dc-cb49245ec5dc","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"基本的に書けば書くほど陳腐化する箇所も増えるので、いかにして書く量 (要素数) を減らすかが大事だったりしますね","ts":"1621825216.045900","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1621825228.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h0K7F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d8a93e7-5f11-4ecd-b094-f2c5733d087e","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ちなみに仕事系は \u003c#C01BAQYHBMX|tech-management\u003e ってチャンネルもあります","ts":"1621825202.045600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"roVm1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9600183-1e70-4212-bcb3-c6c4f9a2a414","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"document, 基本的にソースコードからは読み取れないことを重視して書いてます。プロダクトの意思決定の判断材料とか、将来の方向性とか、やりたいけどやっていないこととか。","ts":"1621825187.044900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Or7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2EAB94E6-FCE7-410E-AF6E-3CEF1D5039BB","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"多分、チームリーダーとどこまでやるかを合意した方が良い気がします\nここまでやるから、後はチームで育ててねって","ts":"1621825176.044500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7FT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d08ada3e-a065-4b29-845f-303cb6a5c545","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ある程度ちゃんとチームとして機能してるならそんなに膨大な資料残す必要とかないはずですけどね・・・まあそういう状況になるのもあるんで仕方なしですが。\nそういうときはマネージメント側が悪いので最善を尽くすだけでいい気がします。","ts":"1621825148.043000","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1621828437.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Cc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aeb8938a-8bf5-4ccf-91e9-88b0dc59e90e","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"なるほど…。自社でクラウド型BtoB向けパッケージを作って提供しているので障害を起こさないようにしなければいけない（フェイルセーフ機構は備えていますけど）んですが、1から10まで残そうとすると100ページは軽く超えそうなんですよね…。\nかといってインフラチームは泥臭い仕事で若い人達は全然寄り付かないのでどこまで押さえておくべきか悩ましいって感じなんです。裏でAWSを使っているとはいえ、それなりの知識は要求されますし。","ts":"1621824921.041200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IzAvp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cff8209e-4e65-4f14-bc0e-1f34c0629c50","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"資料はあればあるほどいい認識ですね\n何が必要になるかは事前にわからないので・・・","ts":"1621824645.039700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2d/dC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A2429992-95C1-4333-87A0-154E399AFF69","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"後釜の技量次第な気がしますのでその人に合わせて作るのもありと思います\n\nもっと汎用的に作るなら、自分はさっき言った通りにやると思います","ts":"1621823833.033800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t6mD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2F1455DD-E7FC-41EF-923F-59F58C8F07BB","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自分なら、新人が見ても、分からないところ相談できるレベルの資料を作ると思います","ts":"1621823765.032200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nxs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ebb8f69-3b59-4cdd-8154-1d8d50074047","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"理想はそもそも普段から常に抜けても大丈夫な状態にしておくこと。もちろん理想論ではありますが。","ts":"1621823559.030300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qf4Cp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a94e520-6ccc-40ed-b012-a33b95733910","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"受け取り手の技量による、な気がします...","ts":"1621823322.029800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Ibd0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1126294-3bcb-43e5-9722-e5627b319d1d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"転職希望とかそういうのじゃないのですが、仕事についての相談なのでこちらにて。今勤めてる会社はそこそこ良い環境を用意してくれているんですが、もし転職する事になったとして後釜へどれぐらいの粒度の資料を残しておくのが正解なのかなとふと思いまして…。\n新卒で入った会社が~客先常駐SESのクソゴミで、かつ新卒なのに逃げた奴の尻ぬぐいをさせられた~のでMarkdownテキストを使った手順書を時間のある時に細々と作っているのですが、こういうのにキャプチャ画像なども全て含めておくべきなのかなと。ただ、あんまりゴテゴテしていると引き継ぎの負荷が高くなるんじゃと悩ましくて。","ts":"1621823148.029400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GUG"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"\u003c@U022PB40WAF\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621822633.023700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U0223FAS8NB","text":"\u003c@U0223FAS8NB\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621820949.023400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
